                <syl /><neume facs="#m-349fd791-bd08-44dc-90f9-d9696a13e80f" type="punctum" xml:id="m-2d81d74f-bdc1-4860-bf07-b64d3c58ae28">
                  <nc xml:id="m-bce8212e-6baa-417e-8479-286d71cc3599" pname="a" oct="3" /></neume></syllable><syllable xml:id="m-fee49100-9df0-49d6-bfbc-d02a2edd8348">
                <syl /><neume facs="#m-dcf1fa87-34f7-424e-896f-bc5f94d1454a" type="punctum" xml:id="m-064cf5ba-67e4-4604-8f62-254bca920ffd">
                  <nc xml:id="m-0b6be55a-e22c-43dc-ae0c-0ddfc73c7add" pname="g" oct="3"><episema xml:id="m-e77e86e2-804a-460c-992a-d0f33e92e21b" form="v" /></nc></neume></syllable><divLine xml:id="m-481f3d78-a384-40bd-9f46-86cb891b6a18" facs="#m-90af7e40-4bd6-4b02-bee9-11e1f297b0a1" form="finalis" /></layer></staff><div xml:id="m-d29494bb-62ba-43c2-9e58-19dfff0aae8b"><lg xml:id="m-47248557-92cb-43f4-a63e-83f96c755eef"><l xml:id="m-4d13b9c4-d680-4e3e-bfaa-dc552413aa7f" facs="#m-677121ad-979c-4f4a-a300-75565fc235da" label="text-like">At Matins.</l><l xml:id="m-6496bc3c-1273-495a-b8ea-6c57608c047e" facs="#m-7fb8feba-d9c2-4490-bb0e-cdf55c850757" label="ambiguous">1707</l><l xml:id="m-84df53bc-6e9d-4652-a2ee-680bccdd9bd5" facs="#m-5b5278fc-41d8-459d-b6f8-3a6671536c40" label="ambiguous">Lesson VII.</l><l xml:id="m-eafda8ef-7877-4307-b600-fb0af2f64357" facs="#m-16ef3040-e888-4813-94ed-76ba4063673b" label="text-like">Job. 17, 1-3 and 11-15.</l><l xml:id="m-7b213e77-0646-4096-92fa-91e091948326" facs="#m-b29e33b0-bc6b-4afc-a736-c2044fe13a5e" label="lyrics-like">NPíritus meus attenuábitur, dies (Noctem vertérunt in diem. et rur¬</l><l xml:id="m-b9e2a255-4d47-4fba-9804-6a871c026ae4" facs="#m-cec790cf-4357-41d4-b417-470a74c7e73e" label="ambiguous">O mei breviabuntur, et solum</l><l xml:id="m-c20e957a-6981-4e6f-8495-ab5797d2ef7f" facs="#m-b3013de5-3b93-4f3f-9382-26c41091de71" label="lyrics-like">sum post ténebras spero lucem.</l><l xml:id="m-82a8fc84-846c-4166-a102-b3fda6bbacad" facs="#m-abbd043c-37b6-4421-b638-a49e78e9e531" label="lyrics-like">mihi súperest sepúlcrum. Non pec¬</l><l xml:id="m-960e7133-50af-418d-88dc-e12eb10c7a5d" facs="#m-d9d5ebc9-a063-4f80-979e-a40af2b2885a" label="lyrics-like">si sustinúero, inférnus domus mea</l><l xml:id="m-64648122-6e18-4585-b8e7-23a85dfba0ee" facs="#m-d272ae39-5d6c-4e7e-95b2-82df69f3fd26" label="lyrics-like">est, et in ténebris stravi léctulum</l><l xml:id="m-978c8242-e1ab-469b-8415-50761e7f4118" facs="#m-7b406bb9-5883-4ffd-b31d-3be7b86c5a8d" label="lyrics-like">cávi, et in amaritudinibus morátur</l><l xml:id="m-c911ad59-7beb-4fd1-b293-4337d9f7abed" facs="#m-12ac31ba-d9ac-49af-ab53-79c976ca0567" label="lyrics-like">óculus meus. Libera me Dómine, et</l><l xml:id="m-6edc3bc7-1b73-4e5e-a713-249ae5f33788" facs="#m-022778fe-8856-4938-8d77-8d63b1c1d3be" label="lyrics-like">meum. Putrédini dixi : Pater meus</l><l xml:id="m-9e478576-4570-4b5e-a0ca-8920424eae23" facs="#m-e690e2b8-fde7-47c1-8a89-ab4cfc3be314" label="lyrics-like">pone me juxta te, et cujúsvis ma¬</l><l xml:id="m-b06d95e2-5249-43d8-aa1b-2749e6272809" facs="#m-8e6dbed7-4b75-4d74-8b15-f45fdf079e06" label="lyrics-like">es, mater mea, et soror mea, vér¬</l><l xml:id="m-e40a4873-30ea-4253-90e8-52ef537864a8" facs="#m-cb83efed-2e4a-48f6-b02f-3d03934adeb1" label="ambiguous">nus pugnet contra me. Dies mei l mibus. Ubi est ergo nunc praesto¬</l><l xml:id="m-82cb7638-8fff-4680-b419-fbfb15100e9b" facs="#m-eb840421-9c13-430e-85a2-f03d9a7e61e9" label="lyrics-like">transiérunt, cogitatiónes meae dis-] látio mea, et patiéntiam meam quis</l><l xml:id="m-f1943d14-ad06-4f1f-9aa9-36220e7aa083" facs="#m-6aff5ae2-6f4e-4db4-ab64-26b67bc04f25" label="lyrics-like">sipátae sunt, torquéntes cor meum. considerat?</l><l xml:id="m-1b8eb5d5-9b5c-492a-8a76-5f63178817fa" facs="#m-cf868947-dc44-485b-ab9f-b0d26d5214d4" label="ambiguous">Resp.</l><l xml:id="m-0a0d23f7-6b41-4f0d-b1f8-4ef26cc6f93f" facs="#m-5fa4ad66-8330-4d03-b355-de6a247c5b6d" label="ambiguous">1.</l><l xml:id="m-9861c1fe-b8a5-4b40-b347-c020b3273ac3" facs="#m-c12e2886-6c29-4bff-8d4d-b64775eacdf3" label="lyrics-like">Eccántem me “quo-tí-di-e, et non me paeni¬</l><l xml:id="m-e478d9c0-d1d2-410d-912c-87957025f13f" facs="#m-8ec14bf5-bd7b-4c27-be2f-33e2461049aa" label="lyrics-like">tén-tem, tímor mórtis contúr-bat me : “Qui-a in in¬</l><l xml:id="m-42eb9b4e-b049-4487-9db9-a9dc2dc56f8a" facs="#m-9ecd1392-78ba-4b15-98f5-69a2494738be" label="lyrics-like">fér- no núlla est red-émpti¬o</l><l xml:id="m-5214da40-42a5-41d9-bc36-6b0fd0d275a0" facs="#m-132e133a-0d68-4cce-ac0b-5ad74a5011dc" label="lyrics-like">mi-se-ré-re</l><l xml:id="m-d7c256f5-58fa-40cd-a863-24f8d56f279b" facs="#m-d95263ee-741e-4a30-8279-c1edb17ec21b" label="lyrics-like">mé- i Dé-us, et sál- va me. V. Dé-us, in nómine</l><l xml:id="m-132eed72-ec13-4b7d-a4bf-f1bacc7dd1ff" facs="#m-d84e08ab-314d-46d0-aa48-ba317ba67ec3" label="lyrics-like">lí-be¬</l><l xml:id="m-76f3524f-84cf-4325-9337-6d1fdd4d12aa" facs="#m-6e7c7956-7c9e-4d91-b38f-29d20d0c8243" label="lyrics-like">tú-o sál- vum me fac, et in virtú-te tú-a</l><l xml:id="m-b1b645ff-953c-499d-9dfd-ec5f2f090ef7" facs="#m-2f2b31dc-a6d6-4275-83a3-8a36e5fd5861" label="ambiguous">ra me. "Qui-a.</l><l xml:id="m-f7e1808f-a8ec-4439-bcfc-19ef2510b58f" facs="#m-aec3928c-2fd1-420d-b1d2-fdbbed56dc18" label="ambiguous">Lesson VIII.</l><l xml:id="m-6d2c7073-a2d6-4124-95ab-9bdfaa99bd79" facs="#m-62d9b0ca-89b2-49ed-a5b4-703cfc65fecc" label="ambiguous">Job 19, 20-27.</l><l xml:id="m-1d6d33b1-b588-4187-bf9a-ec60450f83cb" facs="#m-fe651c26-8c52-41fc-9c1f-58a2420ff140" label="lyrics-like">OElli meae, consúmptis cárnibus, libro stylo férreo, et plumbi lámi¬</l><l xml:id="m-3e005aed-a666-47c5-8953-369a049ef628" facs="#m-e71f2d2c-15d3-4403-a87e-ae06ae86bc84" label="lyrics-like">adhaésit os meum, et derelicta</l><l xml:id="m-b87774a9-3e87-46fd-a44e-b927da0f9407" facs="#m-453e6e72-8a1d-4cf6-9d5b-ba3945fb26e9" label="lyrics-like">na, vel celte sculpántur in silice?</l><l xml:id="m-eb62f453-6b18-4fb3-b599-f261d9addd18" facs="#m-3ad03fd3-6de8-4e22-91fc-0c3a028d5960" label="lyrics-like">Scio enim quod redémptor meus vi¬</l><l xml:id="m-6b477c23-cf77-4318-9223-7af82af795af" facs="#m-a0abfbf0-f136-4398-93a6-5c80281e6266" label="lyrics-like">sunt tantúmmodo lábia circa dentes</l><l xml:id="m-4004be2a-e4e0-4f09-87bd-f25e9173a040" facs="#m-b2288381-a321-47c2-8236-51d46a176bcf" label="lyrics-like">meos. Miserémini mei, miserémini</l><l xml:id="m-699a7441-36d0-44c8-88f0-673af956947e" facs="#m-28e5454c-0a40-4908-a37a-944f94c262d5" label="lyrics-like">vit, et in novíssimo die de terra sur¬</l><l xml:id="m-3dd43352-0365-48c5-95f1-50ddd801c452" facs="#m-9482b686-354e-4ecd-a206-c725a08edc88" label="lyrics-like">mei, saltem vos amíci mei, quia</l><l xml:id="m-b8cab774-2efa-4d0f-b533-3c6377caff95" facs="#m-900d1b87-616d-4644-bbbd-c754528765d7" label="lyrics-like">rectúrus sum: et rursum circúm¬</l><l xml:id="m-909b41f8-4073-403d-a281-05bf1fb6d221" facs="#m-379e7538-4875-40a9-83cf-d242db1840af" label="lyrics-like">manus Dómini tétigit me. Quare</l><l xml:id="m-c652ac30-8443-4873-b1d3-e15a699df326" facs="#m-ff46a9b2-63b5-4460-9a49-3788d6ac0917" label="ambiguous">dabor pelle mea, et in carne mea</l><l xml:id="m-3f9b5b5b-85cb-4bb4-aa52-fbb4c5aa8f8e" facs="#m-4c90fb35-0b6b-4670-89ee-781cb7aecb25" label="lyrics-like">vidébo Deum meum. Quem visúrus</l><l xml:id="m-10724a40-b059-454a-8a29-7183b27cfb75" facs="#m-e4b4c9fb-abe6-4b99-8485-1c1021f204a6" label="lyrics-like">persequímini me sicut Deus, et</l><l xml:id="m-ef53a5c1-c1ce-4e5d-8ccd-2b47757ee4b2" facs="#m-b500d688-d1c5-41a7-8f8e-7497080fc3b5" label="lyrics-like">cárnibus meis saturámini? Quis mi¬</l><l xml:id="m-a59a4c80-ddc0-45de-8657-75a991bea701" facs="#m-854360bc-719a-4b9b-8e0a-33155b1545a8" label="lyrics-like">sum ego ipse, et óculi mei conspe¬</l><l xml:id="m-2d40e99d-e859-4982-8f21-957064ac3ccb" facs="#m-49c58c58-4a0c-41b4-9a29-88b055a2495e" label="lyrics-like">ctúri sunt, et non álius: repósita</l><l xml:id="m-265b6bdc-6189-466d-b122-af7a4c417f6b" facs="#m-05437762-9224-42bc-bd04-aa9d12fc1f8e" label="lyrics-like">hi tríbuat ut scribántur sermónes</l><l xml:id="m-a4652402-95c1-44c6-bfd3-185ed1e3ad13" facs="#m-3f93fd08-fb98-425e-8e4e-b952498d7148" label="lyrics-like">mei? quis mihi det ut exaréntur in! est haec spes mea in sinu meo.</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>